<title>UK: DSL Finance adds 100 million marks to 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Finance adds 100 million marks to 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT   *400 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    17.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.08    PAY DATE  **16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    101.33    SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING 300 MLN DEM LAUNCHED</p>
<p>		 21.AUG.96</p>
<p>	    **PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
